OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors to get a glimpse inside
OL,4,Adesign studio saved from ruin
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe dilapidated studio of renowned
OL,7,Ftextile designer Bernat Klein is to
OL,8,Fopen its doors to the public for the
OL,9,Ffirst time since a consortium stepped
OL,10,Fin to save it from ruin last year.
OL,12,FThe group secured the site near Selkirk
OL,13,Fin the Borders at auction and now has
OL,14,Fambitious plans to bring it back into
OL,15,Fuse at a cost of more than #3m.
OL,17,FVisitors are being offered a chance to
OL,18,Fsee the building at the very start of
OL,19,Fthe process of bringing it back to life
OL,20,Fas part of two Doors Open Days this
OL,21,Fweekend.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
