OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors to get a glimpse inside
OL,4,Adesign studio saved from ruin
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has a special focus on the modernist
OL,7,Fwork of Peter Womersley who designed
OL,8,Fthe studio and also Klein's nearby home
OL,9,Fat High Sunderland and the cantilevered
OL,10,Fstand at Gala Fairydean Rovers'
OL,11,FNetherdale ground.
